{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5a2b56be8da3eaff17fbfc54a9daeac77f490a7278b5a572442e960541917c5d", "ja": "朗読劇の行方は", "zh": "朗读剧的去向是", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "014794d52489c36d6192a4a0c70798e88e035bee9e2d92808ebd0cfdfbb66f85", "ja": "琴葉は、『STARDOM ROAD』第四幕の\n学園ドラマを扱ったミニ朗読劇の準備中。\n自分が演じた真田湊はもっとチャラいはず\nだとリベンジに余念がない。同公演出演の\n美奈子を相手に、琴葉渾身の湊が炸裂する。", "zh": "琴叶正在为《STARDOM ROAD》第四幕中以校园剧为主题的迷你朗读剧做准备。她认为自己饰演的真田湊本该更加轻浮，因此一心准备着雪耻。面对同场演出的美奈子，琴叶倾尽全力演绎的湊即将火力全开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fa8bce1950c85d56f58f06cea7a67daa0e6aad75821b5cb426e0b6a54d855d84", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第四幕の学園ドラマを\nモチーフにしたミニ朗読劇も、今回の目玉の一つだ）", "zh": "（以《STARDOM ROAD》第四幕的校园剧为主题的迷你朗读剧，也是这次的看点之一）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7c5dabd2cb992a270b00632cf363afb226ef590e9a9cbdde71c1bfe5dd53813b", "ja": "（新規配役でコメディ色も強い、今回限りの特別な\n台本で、今は次の上演に備えて準備中だが……）", "zh": "（这是一份因启用全新角色分配而更具喜剧色彩、仅限这次使用的特别剧本。现在正在为下一场演出做准备，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "20f2243e6accb4f0f4d3a91ca18f5004d81dfc639cf3d9c5977c056babcc049b", "ja": "真珠星！　あ、もしかして髪色変えた？\n超似合ってるんじゃん！", "zh": "真珠星！啊，难道你换发色了？\n超级适合你的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "52e68d07acb02639d6dc47789b60deae187d0f783182159908747a679ec8f9af", "ja": "ううん、違うかな……？\nもうちょっと軽薄な感じを出さないと……！", "zh": "不对，不太对吧……？\n必须再多表现出一点轻浮的感觉才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "f70d357bb672f6d3e2130419b538a28068eb9c438afa78997d15cb87046744d1", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、\n真田湊の練習に熱が入ってるわね……。", "zh": "琴叶，练习真田湊这个角色时还真投入呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "a122dd18ef222a5d3a8a30a35d25d47c502434581f6fecfd49f3a33c71e444e9", "ja": "同じ役じゃなくてもいいんだよね？　わたし、\n琴葉さんのいろんな役、見てみたかったなぁ。", "zh": "就算不是同一个角色也没关系吧？\n我还挺想多看看琴叶小姐演各种不同的角色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "62cce7ff38a9327c87259e0f56dca27b73e88f1c0b491c387d5a2354b247ad50", "ja": "真珠星とかも、きっと似合うと思う！", "zh": "我觉得像珍珠星之类的角色，琴叶姐姐演起来肯定也很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "65250aac47cdba1c175bbe2b76b830de51e057cf89f2ec087d611e683e1f841e", "ja": "ありがとう、育ちゃん。\nでも、私、真田湊を演りたいの。", "zh": "谢谢你，育。\n不过，我想演真田凑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "26a9335d3395d8f38ba15ee7a8daf4f97b7b44c2ec09bfbed70f7e3b31303325", "ja": "前に演じた時に……好評だったから。\nそのリベンジを……。", "zh": "因为之前演过……反响很好。\n所以想再挑战一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "270094c922278d89b8d08ca88b7ed10d3125a890a9b095743340f860d695a355", "ja": "？　好評なのに、リベンジ……？", "zh": "？明明反响很好，还要重新挑战……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "d3c1df382b37c7e1d81d43ff66b1739bce969ca1d8780306e8565a62994846a8", "ja": "その……私はイヤな役として演じたつもり\nだったんですけど、お客さんの反応が……。", "zh": "那个……我本来是打算演一个讨人嫌的角色，可是客人的反应……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0ec97990e340e71a8c3462f56d02d7cf75f519d65759318215b706ea41527716", "ja": "「意外とアリ」とか「もっと出番ほしかった」とか、\nかなり好意的だったな。", "zh": "比如“意外地挺不错”或者“希望能有更多出场戏份”之类的，\n反响相当不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "3d0ec6138b659c29111fb530ec4bef72cf334bc3a2ade997a802db7a988829af", "ja": "そうなんです！\n真田湊は、もっとイヤがってもらわないと……！", "zh": "就是这样！\n要让大家更讨厌真田湊才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c7f34102cb72fbac925d0da1a9eb219521fdb2c14bc9262abdd3e3ec4f195da", "ja": "きっと、私にチャラさが足りなかったんです。\n実力不足でした……。", "zh": "一定是因为我还不够轻浮。\n是我实力不足……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "d7e1228c22ad7f0c082b4a053f77148693c92c7f13395731b5cbd5e9203a8c11", "ja": "そ、そうかしら……？\nしっかりキャラは立っていたと思うけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？\n我觉得角色塑造得很鲜明啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "0b8dd0e9bdfed11b53f8d30752f22fe885fd595a7ca4ac277889d961e8b59a67", "ja": "いいえ。もっとチャラくて、軽薄で、信用できなくて、\n鼻持ちならない感じを表現してみたいんです。", "zh": "不。我想表现得更加轻浮、肤浅、不可靠，\n还要让人觉得难以忍受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc81519345e0a27223df30825ac1ec7dab939d737369ff8c9dadbc2fbe4f12a3", "ja": "私だけがもらった役でもありますから。\n私の真田湊で、劇場のみんなをナンパしてみせます！", "zh": "这也是只有我才能拿到的角色。\n我会用我的真田湊，去搭讪剧场里的所有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "17e1ac750345c480db273237ff9715a8be5a9dafc090c804ffcc123a37a23f6d", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん！？　急にどうしたの？", "zh": "琴叶！？怎么突然了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f3fe889c1db5416f9f8585730e185bb1b48de24c2004709c65712d0d0e7d2340", "ja": "お疲れさま、美奈子。\n美奈子も朗読劇に出るんだったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。\n你也要参加朗读剧来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "cefedf4cb2875b2c3c7af8f36ee90953228c3e51cf8485891519330ee38ff803", "ja": "あ、はい、入場エリアのシフトが終わったところです。\n……それより、琴葉ちゃんが今、ナンパって……？", "zh": "啊，是的，刚刚结束入场区域的轮班。\n……比起这个，琴叶刚才说的是“搭讪”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "721a48c3b8dcea1c348ccd023eef42102f77f0f9ab9c9f4a178c549e410e28a0", "ja": "責任をもって真田湊をやる。\nそういう決意表明をしたの。", "zh": "我会负责任地演好真田湊。这是我做出的决心宣言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "4a6de1941a89e4355bf51fa7b48d6426b10c2d756567890215d810bd0ebae12b", "ja": "美奈子ちゃん。同じ第四幕に立った者として、\n進化した真田湊……見届けてね。", "zh": "美奈子。作为和我一起登上第四幕舞台的人，请见证进化后的真田湊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "105d58c7593c6f72d7696f3fbd951eb587f53875fb21be61fb3bb05d6236245b", "ja": "う、うん。見届けるけど……\nあの、これは一体どういう流れで……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。看我是会看的啦……\n那个，这到底是怎么一回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "5ebbb5c0bf2614fbcd80e3be56ba2c7d393730fc03fe735e726434e14dd4e512", "ja": "火が点いてしまったみたいなの。\n琴葉ちゃんの役者魂に……。", "zh": "好像被点燃了呢。\n琴叶的演员魂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "f9f48b9adc295bb22d54e2a577fdd13556e95fc9c56ca9050d74962bfb88fde2", "ja": "琴葉さんの、本気の演技……すっごく勉強になりそう！\nわたしも、しっかり見せてもらおうっと。", "zh": "琴叶的认真演技……感觉一定能学到好多东西！  \n我也要好好观摩一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2ee848c22b956b01479708e1a4f76d9a852603e3e65090a888d6bef136e917b5", "ja": "というわけだ。\n美奈子、受け止めてあげてほしい。", "zh": "所以就是这样。  \n美奈子，希望你能好好接纳她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "6ba94aa3d00c20831f8b0232d0d9cb4c132b9c87dcf011e2e7180d75fe9c194a", "ja": "は、はい。よくわかりませんけど……。\n私にできることなら、全力でお手伝いします！", "zh": "是、是的。虽然不是很明白……但只要是我能做到的，我一定会全力帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "515b04202e52a7a39ebbdaaa6ad9941f4e12e4a35c3913ff057fb43c4495d424", "ja": "集中、集中して……普段の私は捨てて……。\n新しい境地、新しい表現を……！", "zh": "集中精神，集中精神……抛开平时的自己……\n全新的境界，全新的表现……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "f69d1d73a854f7748e0821b44ae05ae0dccefdbcc576f436581c4407ee104050", "ja": "ウェーイ！\n真珠星、今日もかわうぃーネェーィ☆", "zh": "耶——！\n珍珠星，今天也超可爱哎——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0373_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_04_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
